{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[AFANTASIA]</strong> is a surreal exploration game that follows a boy conflicted with his sense of identity in his hometown: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Tempo.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Run.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an <strong>atmospheric</strong> <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/BusStop.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location reveals unique <strong>puzzles</strong> and <strong>psychological mysteries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/QualiaCubes.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide the protagonist's path in this <strong>philosophical</strong>, <strong>cinematic</strong> narrative that invites you to question <strong>reality</strong> and uncover <strong>hidden</strong> truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Lookout.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore\u00a0<strong>surreal </strong>scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/AloeVera.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All accompanied by an <strong>original, evocative soundtrack</strong>. Explore <strong>memories</strong> and talk with the town\u2019s inhabitants, experiencing <strong>varied gameplay</strong> styles, all brought to life with <strong>stylized pixel art</strong> and beautiful <strong>dithering</strong> effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>DogHome</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/DogHome.gif?t=1745199097\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Alley</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Alley.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Condominium</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Condominium.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336670?t=1745199097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/44074041ea6696f185366a3f6bc78e58691f5414/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745199097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/6adc76b85eca5b7b9d6770ee6a5937f7351d2624/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745199097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/6adc76b85eca5b7b9d6770ee6a5937f7351d2624/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745199097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[AFANTASIA]</strong> is a surreal exploration game that follows a boy conflicted with his sense of identity in his hometown: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Tempo.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Run.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an <strong>atmospheric</strong> <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/BusStop.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location reveals unique <strong>puzzles</strong> and <strong>psychological mysteries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/QualiaCubes.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide the protagonist's path in this <strong>philosophical</strong>, <strong>cinematic</strong> narrative that invites you to question <strong>reality</strong> and uncover <strong>hidden</strong> truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Lookout.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore\u00a0<strong>surreal </strong>scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/AloeVera.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All accompanied by an <strong>original, evocative soundtrack</strong>. Explore <strong>memories</strong> and talk with the town\u2019s inhabitants, experiencing <strong>varied gameplay</strong> styles, all brought to life with <strong>stylized pixel art</strong> and beautiful <strong>dithering</strong> effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>DogHome</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/DogHome.gif?t=1745199097\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Alley</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Alley.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Condominium</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/Condominium.gif?t=1745199097\" /></p>","developers":["noidnoidnoid"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/4fccd522cb191c0b071399e2c471fe7460bcbbc9/header.jpg?t=1745199097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126901,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126901/movie480.mp4?t=1745198176","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126901/movie_max.mp4?t=1745198176"},"name":"[AFANTASIA] - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126901/f915ef8a3278c5e74b1bb22577149be0cc4b78a1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745198176","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126901/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745198176","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126901/movi